     A* Subfile record formats and their keywords.
     A* Member: DSPSFL   Compilable: yes
     A* Source: IBM i 7.5 DDS for display files, subfile keywords.
     A* Retrieved: 2026-07-25
     A*
     A* The subfile record holds one row of the list.
00010A          R CUSTSFL                   SFL
00020A            SELECT         1A  B 10  2
00030A            CUSTNO         6S 0O    +2
00040A            CUSTNAME      30A  O    +2
     A*
     A* The subfile control record governs how the list is displayed.
00050A          R CUSTCTL                   SFLCTL(CUSTSFL)
00060A                                      SFLSIZ(0010)
00070A                                      SFLPAG(0009)
00080A  31                                  SFLDSP
00090A  32                                  SFLDSPCTL
00100A  33                                  SFLCLR
00110A  34                                  SFLEND(*MORE)
00120A                                      SFLRCDNBR(CURSOR)
00130A                                      OVERLAY
     A*
     A* Other subfile keywords.
00140A                                      SFLDROP(CF05)
00150A                                      SFLFOLD(CF05)
00160A                                      SFLLIN(0002)
00170A                                      SFLMSG('No records found' 40)
00180A                                      SFLMSGID(USR0001 QGPL/MYMSGF 41)
00190A                                      SFLMSGKEY
00200A                                      SFLMSGRCD(24)
00210A                                      SFLNXTCHG
00220A                                      SFLINZ
00230A                                      SFLRNA
00240A                                      SFLCSRRRN(&RRNFLD)
00250A                                      SFLSCROLL(&SCRFLD)
00260A                                      SFLMODE(&MODEFLD)
00270A                                      SFLENTER(CF06)
